{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X在少数短停留段里感受句同时铺得较满，第一眼扫速不如Y的短词列。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"Y更容易快速扫过，但右侧短词常像一串气氛标签，和左边人物念头之间的对应关系要观众自己补。X靠短句、加亮词和到时出现，把“发生了什么—为什么收住/又靠近—音乐此刻怎样”接得更紧，前后反复出现的亲近、舍不得、收住、再放开也更像同一条心理线；感受则多半落到具体的身体、声音和动作变化上，所以整体更细、更连贯。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a5fb59ce-face-4f45-ab4e-2f892c06e072", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T040747442520Z", "elapsed_seconds": 14.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:08:01.975480+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c5ef74268e0a7b1f8fff99ff3628b5aeb18b4749664175e7ab48b184487d8290", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete